OL,3,GNEWSAFears wildfire could reignite as
OL,4,Ahot spots remain
OL,5,
OL,6,FFears have been raised that fires could
OL,7,Freignite at a nature reserve that was
OL,8,Fdevastated during a huge blaze.
OL,10,FLarge parts of Dunwich Heath and of
OL,11,Fneighbouring RSPB Minsmere on the
OL,12,FSuffolk coast were destroyed by a
OL,13,Fwildfire that ripped through an area
OL,14,Fthe size of 210 football pitches on 29
OL,15,FJuly.
OL,17,FThe National Trust, which owns and
OL,18,Fmanages Dunwich Heath, said its teams
OL,19,Fhad been on site and had found hot
OL,20,Fspots and patches of ground smoking,
OL,21,Fprompting fears that unidentified areas
OL,22,Fcould reignite.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
